#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:4
msgid "自定义 Python 模块"
msgstr "Custom Python modules"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:6
msgid ""
"本章节介绍如何在 DaoAI 天眼系统的工作流中编写与使用“自定义Python 模块”（Custom Python Blocks）。 通过自定义 "
"Python 代码，您可以实现特定业务逻辑、后处理、数据转换、与外部系统交互等能力，并与平台内置模块一起构建完整的 AI 视觉工作流。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter introduces how to write and use \"Custom Python Blocks\" in the"
" workflow of the DaoAI Video Analysis Platform.By customizing Python code, you can "
"implement specific business logic, post-processing, data conversion, "
"interaction with external systems, and other capabilities, and build a "
"complete AI vision workflow together with the platform's built-in modules."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:15
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:17
msgid "内置模块无法覆盖的业务规则或特定算法逻辑；"
msgstr ""
"Business rules or specific algorithm logic that cannot be covered by built-"
"in modules;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:18
msgid "对模型输出进行后处理（筛选、聚合、统计、重排）；"
msgstr ""
"Post-process the model output (filtering, aggregation, statistics, "
"rearrangement);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:19
msgid "将工作流结果转为下游系统可用的数据格式；"
msgstr ""
"Convert workflow results into data formats usable by downstream systems;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:20
msgid "轻量的外部调用（如 HTTP 请求）或状态记录（注意时延与可靠性）。"
msgstr ""
"Lightweight external calls (such as HTTP requests) or status logging (pay "
"attention to latency and reliability)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:23
msgid "状态管理最佳实践"
msgstr "State Management Best Practices"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:25
msgid "在自定义 Python 模块中，状态（state）主要用于缓存高成本计算和优化工件、依赖的加载："
msgstr ""
"In custom Python modules, state is mainly used to cache high-cost "
"calculations and optimize the loading of artifacts and dependencies:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:27
msgid "不要依赖状态进行关键数据持久化：重要数据请使用外部存储（数据库、对象存储等）；"
msgstr ""
"Do not rely on state for key data persistence: please use external storage "
"(database, object storage, etc.) for important data;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:28
msgid "状态可能随时丢失：服务器重启或容器弹性伸缩都会导致状态丢失；"
msgstr ""
"The state may be lost at any time: server restart or container auto-scaling "
"will cause state loss;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:29
msgid "初始化默认值：为模块作用域内的变量设置合理默认值，以应对“冷启动”；"
msgstr ""
"Initialization default values: Set reasonable default values ​​for variables"
" within the module scope to cope with \"cold start\";"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:30
msgid "保持状态轻量：大型对象会占用内存并影响性能。"
msgstr ""
"Keep state lightweight: Large objects take up memory and impact performance."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:33
msgid "原理概述（Theory）"
msgstr "Overview of principles (Theory)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:35
msgid "自定义 Python 模块的高层工作机制如下："
msgstr ""
"The high-level working mechanism of custom Python modules is as follows:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:37
msgid "用户以 JSON 文档形式提供动态模块的定义；"
msgstr ""
"Users provide definitions of dynamic modules in the form of JSON documents;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:38
msgid ""
"该定义包含由执行引擎（Execution Engine）构造 WorkflowBlockManifest 与 WorkflowBlock 所需的信息；"
msgstr ""
"This definition contains the information required by the Execution Engine to"
" construct WorkflowBlockManifest and WorkflowBlock;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:39
msgid "在运行时，编译器（Compiler）会将该定义转译为动态创建的 Python 类——其行为等同于静态定义的模块；"
msgstr ""
"At runtime, the compiler translates this definition into a dynamically "
"created Python class - which behaves like a statically defined module;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:40
msgid "在工作流定义中，您可以像使用标准静态模块一样声明与连接动态模块步骤。"
msgstr ""
"In a workflow definition, you declare and wire dynamic module steps just "
"like standard static modules."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:44
msgid "创建一个 Python 模块"
msgstr "Create a Python module"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:46
msgid "您可以在工作流编辑器中添加“Python 模块”并填写代码。一个典型的 Python 模块包含："
msgstr ""
"You can add a \"Python module\" and fill in the code in the workflow "
"editor.A typical Python module contains:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:48
msgid "Python Block Editor"
msgstr "Python Block Editor"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:53
msgid "参数定义：作为模块的可配置项（例如检测结果、布尔条件或整数参数等）；"
msgstr ""
"Parameter definition: as a configurable item of the module (such as "
"detection results, Boolean conditions or integer parameters, etc.);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:54
msgid "入口方法：平台在运行时调用该方法，传入工作流的输入与模块参数；"
msgstr ""
"Entry method: The platform calls this method at runtime and passes in the "
"input and module parameters of the workflow;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:55
msgid "返回值：返回 JSON 可序列化的结构，供后续模块或输出使用。"
msgstr ""
"Return value: Returns a JSON serializable structure for use by subsequent "
"modules or output."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:59
msgid "可用的标准库与依赖"
msgstr "Available standard libraries and dependencies"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:61
msgid "在python模块编辑页面，您可以点击 可用库 查看当前环境支持的标准库与第三方依赖包列表。"
msgstr ""
"On the python module editing page, you can click Available Libraries to view"
" the list of standard libraries and third-party dependency packages "
"supported by the current environment."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:63
msgid "请避免使用未列出的包，以免运行时报错。"
msgstr "Please avoid using unlisted packages to avoid errors when running."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:65
msgid "Available Libraries"
msgstr "Available Libraries"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:72
msgid "示例：根据当前时间切换昼夜两种模型"
msgstr ""
"Example: Switch between day and night models based on the current time"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:74
msgid "下面示例展示一个最简单的 Python 模块：获取当前时间，并根据时间段返回不同的模型ID, 来切换昼夜两种模型。"
msgstr ""
"The following example shows the simplest Python module: getting the current "
"time and returning different model IDs according to the time period to "
"switch between day and night models."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:97
msgid "在工作流中的连接方式："
msgstr "How to connect in a workflow:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:99
msgid "将模型节点的模型ID 输入端连接该 Python 模块的 ``Model_ID`` 输出字段。"
msgstr ""
"Wire the model node's model ID input to the Python module's ``Model_ID`` "
"output field."

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:103
msgid "示例：统计目标数量并用http请求发送"
msgstr "Example: Count the number of targets and send them with http requests"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:105
msgid "示例说明："
msgstr "Example description:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:107
msgid "功能描述："
msgstr "Function description:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:108
msgid ""
"从 ``prediction`` 中统计类别为 ``car`` 的目标数量，并以 JSON 负载通过 ``input_url`` 向外部 HTTP "
"服务发送；"
msgstr ""
"Count the number of targets with category ``car`` from ``prediction`` and "
"send it to the external HTTP service through ``input_url`` as a JSON "
"payload;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/dynamic_python_blocks.rst:109
msgid "返回外部服务的 ``status_code`` 与 ``message``，便于在日志或事件保存模块中记录。"
msgstr ""
"Return the ``status_code`` and ``message`` of the external service to "
"facilitate recording in the log or event saving module."
